## 🔗 Ontology & Relationships (Nexus Readiness)

To allow the future Nexus Correlation Engine to build complex threat links, every module in v0.5 registers semantic relations:

| Module | Subject Type | Subject Value | Relationship | Object Type | Object Value | Evidence |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `footprint` | `domain` | `example.com` | `resolves_to` | `ip` | `93.184.216.34` | `footprint dns lookup` |
| `geoip` | `ip` | `8.8.8.8` | `located_in` | `location` | `City, Region, Country` | `geoip lookup` |
| `netscan` | `network` | `192.168.1.0/24` | `has_active_host` | `ip` | `192.168.1.5` | `probe network scan` |
| `scan` | `ip` | `192.168.1.5` | `has_open_port` | `port` | `22/SSH` | `port scan` |
| `subdomain` | `domain` | `example.com` | `has_subdomain` | `domain` | `blog.example.com` | `crt.sh passive lookup` |
| `tech` | `domain` | `example.com` | `uses_server` | `server` | `nginx/1.18.0` | `http server header` |
| `tech` | `domain` | `example.com` | `uses_technology` | `tech` | `WordPress` | `web framework detection` |
| `crawl` | `url` | `http://test.com` | `has_title` | `title` | `Test Homepage` | `web crawl` |
| `crawl` | `url` | `http://test.com` | `links_to` | `url` | `http://test.com/about` | `web crawl` |
| `crawl` | `url` | `http://test.com` | `has_form` | `form` | `POST -> /login` | `web crawl` |

